title: Hyperinflation
subtitle: The Reichsmark is collapsing from our deficit spending programs.
view-if: inflation >= 25 and spd_in_government and hyperinflation >= 0.2
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: capital_strike_progress += 3; hyperinflation += 0.6; workers_spd -= 11; old_middle_spd -= 16; new_middle_spd -= 18; rural_spd -= 14; unemployed_spd -= 10; pro_republic -= 12; unemployed_kpd += 3; unemployed_kpd += 2 if sapd_consolidated == 0; unemployed_sapd += 2 if sapd_consolidated == 1; unemployed_nsdap += 5 if nazis_in_crisis_seen == 0; unemployed_kpd += 3 if nazis_in_crisis_seen == 1; unemployed_kpd += 2 if nazis_in_crisis_seen == 1 and sapd_consolidated == 0; unemployed_sapd += 2 if nazis_in_crisis_seen == 1 and sapd_consolidated == 1; coalition_dissent += 2
tags: event

= Hyperinflation

Inflation has skyrocketed. People of all classes have seen their purchasing power plummet, and blame the SPD as it seems 1923 is repeating all over again. The extremists against the republic clamor at this opportunity [? if sapd_consolidated : , as does the SAPD, which rallies against us ?].

We must take some action.

- @taxes: We must raise taxes.
- @welfare: We must reduce welfare and social spending.
- @price_controls: Impose strict price and wage controls.
- @volksmark: We must adopt a wholly new currency!
- @increase_currency_acceptance: We shall work on increasing acceptance for a new currency.
- @nothing: Realistically, there is nothing we can do.

@taxes
on-arrival: upper_tax_rates += 2; lower_tax_rates += 2; budget += 4; unemployed += 3; inflation -= 2; hyperinflation -= 0.4; new_middle_spd -= 7; old_middle_spd -= 8; workers_spd -= 5; rural_spd -= 5; kpd_coalition_dissent += 1; kpd_relation -= 10; left_dissent += 10; center_dissent -= 5; month_actions += 1;

Raising taxes is unpopular among everyone, but it might be what it takes to keep inflation under control.

@welfare
on-arrival: welfare -= 2; budget += 2; capital_strike_progress -= 3; unemployed += 3; new_middle_spd += 6*(1-dissent); old_middle_spd += 6*(1-dissent); workers_spd -= 10; unemployed_spd -= 10; inflation -= 2; hyperinflation -= 0.4; left_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 10; center_dissent += 5; kpd_coalition_dissent += 1; month_actions += 1;

Reducing the amount of government spending should reduce the inflation rate, according to classical economics. But it imposes pain upon the people who are suffering the most.

@price_controls
on-arrival: capital_strike_progress += 6; inflation *= 0.75; hyperinflation = 0; coalition_dissent += 2; unemployed += 2; old_middle_spd -= 8; new_middle_spd -= 6; rural_spd -= 12; workers_spd -= 4; unemployed_spd += 5; labor_dissent += 12; dvp_relation -= 15; z_relation -= 8; ddp_relation -= 6; month_actions += 1;

Price controls are very unpopular with the bourgeoisie and their representatives, as well as rural producers, while wage controls hurt organized workers. However, the policies do stem the tide of inflation, at least somewhat.

@volksmark
choose-if: devaluation_progress >= 2 and z_relation >= 40 and ddp_relation >= 50;
on-arrival: volksmark = 1; inflation = 5; hyperinflation = 0; economic_growth = 1; 
subtitle: [? if devaluation_progress < 3 : Decoupling the Volksmark from gold is not feasible yes, more work needs to be done convincing the party. ?] [? if z_relation < 40 : The Zentrum are not convinced of the benefits of a new currency. ?] [? if ddp_relation < 50 : The DDP are weary of the initiative. ?]

Finally, after support from our party, and our coalition partners, we can adopt a new currency, the Volksmark, which is completely decoupled from gold.

@increase_currency_acceptance
view-if: devaluation_progress < 2
on-arrival: devaluation_progress += 1; new_currency_support_card_flag = 1; month_actions += 1;

We are working on increasing the acceptance of a new currency, unpegged to gold. This will take time, and highly theoretical work, however the benefits of a new currency are clear, as it will allow us to have more control over our monetary policy.


@nothing
on-arrival: capital_strike_progress += 2; coalition_dissent += 1; hyperinflation += 0.1; month_actions += 1;

Realistically, there is nothing we can do to stem the tide of inflation.

